
Warm Cottage Developer Center

Warm Cottage is not a chat window. It is a room where you can share everyday life. Tap her to interact, have her cook, tidy the desk, 
or turn the lights off and rest. You can also write notes with reminders and look back at the memories you made together. After you subscribe,
you can chat, play rock-paper-scissors, and play the memory match. Her mood, energy, and closeness change along with these moments. 
The company lives in what you do together in the room, not only in a single thread of messages.
